# Model cache lives on this volume

Ajinkya does **not** give Gemini access to `/Volumes/Wednesday/Conservation Projects/TurtleID`. Home-directory HF caches (`~/.cache/huggingface`) have been wiped by outside cleanup and lost BioCLIP 2.5, BioCAP, DINOv2, and GroundingDINO weights.

**Always:**

- Download and store Hugging Face / OpenCLIP / transformers weights under `models/hf_cache/` on this volume.
- Rely on `config.py` setting `HF_HOME` / `HUGGINGFACE_HUB_CACHE` before any model load.
- Never assume `~/.cache/huggingface` still has TurtleID models.
- When the stack needs models again, warm the on-volume cache first; do not reintroduce home-only caching.
